  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### Unable to submit P46 \n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 14 Nov, 2025 at 12:00 PM\n\n\t\tUnable to Submit P46 \n\nIf you are having trouble submitting a P46, there are a few things to keep in mind. Here are some common issues and solutions to help you get back on track:\n\n1. Check the Deadlines: Make sure you are aware of the deadlines for P46 submissions. The deadlines may vary depending on the specific circumstances, so it's important to stay informed and submit the necessary information on time.\n\n2. Verify the Information: Double-check the information you are entering on the P46 form. Any inaccuracies or missing details could prevent the submission from going through. Take the time to review the form and ensure all the information is correct.\n\n Please refer to the link below for more help. URL: https://www.gov.uk/tell-hmrc-company-car \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188533\">Payroll Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Unable to submit P46 \n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 14 Nov, 2025 at 12:00 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Unable to Submit P46&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If you are having trouble submitting a P46, there are a few things to keep in mind. Here are some common issues and solutions to help you get back on track:</p><p><br></p><p>1. Check the Deadlines: Make sure you are aware of the deadlines for P46 submissions. The deadlines may vary depending on the specific circumstances, so it's important to stay informed and submit the necessary information on time.</p><p><br></p><p>2. Verify the Information: Double-check the information you are entering on the P46 form. Any inaccuracies or missing details could prevent the submission from going through. Take the time to review the form and ensure all the information is correct.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decora